      "blockName": "Source",
      "blockType": "Source",
      "rawSource": "\t\u0026isOK = true\n\t\u0026CarreraNo = 0\n\t\n\tfor \u0026SDTCarreraItem in \u0026SDTCarrera\n\t\tif(\u0026SDTCarreraItem.CarreraEstado = EstadoCarrera.Terminada)\n\t\t\t\u0026CarreraNo = \u0026SDTCarreraItem.CarreraNo\n\t\t\t\u0026isOK = false\n\t\t\tExit\n\t\tendif\n\tendfor\n \n        if(Not \u0026isOK)\n              msg(\u0027Debe validar la carrera #\u0027 \u002B \u0026CarreraNo.ToString())\n\tendif\n",
